==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|physics}} A [[measure]] of the [[ability]] of a body to [[conduct]] [[electricity]]; the [[reciprocal]] of its [[resistance]].
SI unit: siemen (S)

====Related terms====
* [[conductivity]]
* [[thermal conductance]]

